19	 * and exposes the resolved list of countries via {@see getCountries()}.
20	 *
21	 * Mirrors {@see CountryISOSet} (singular) for pattern consistency.
22	 *
23	 * @package Countries
24	 * @subpackage API
25	 * @see AppCountriesParamRule
26	 */
